# .fork/fork-candidates -- foreign forks worth replaying onto this fork.
#
#   <slug>  <repository URL>  <branch>
#
# One entry per line; '#' starts a comment.  The slug names the replay branch
# (replay/<slug>) and the report.  Run them with:
#
#   .fork/scripts/replay-candidates.sh .fork/fork-candidates <reports-dir>
#
# or replay a single fork directly:
#
#   .fork/scripts/fork-replay.sh --fork URL --branch NAME [--push|--pr]
#
# The list is a review queue, not an endorsement: an entry says "worth
# reading", and the replay output is a review artifact, never evidence that
# anything works.

